Package: amitos-installer
Version: 0.3.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Ashutosh Pandey <ashutoshpandeyies@gmail.com>
Description: amitOS Official Installer
 GUI Installer wizard for amitOS, the Industrial Edge AI OS.
 Contains the amitFS filesystem kernel module, Netplan+Nginx configs,
 and OPC UA / Industrial adapters.
